 ],
 "note": "getProcessor builds a PhaseOptimizer over the test field `passes` (a List<PassFactory> whose internal factories are lambdas, so the record lists them as unrepresentable; only each factory's name is recorded). Every test method sets `passes = new ArrayList<>()` and then calls a fixed sequence of add*() methods (the destructuring tests do so through setDestructuringArrowFunctionOptions); cases are therefore keyed on the test method, and each case names that method's add*() sequence. The recorded factory names confirm each sequence: inlineVariables+peepholeOptimizations, inlineFunctions+peepholeOptimizations, collapseObjectLiterals, removeUnusedClassProperties, removeUnusedVars, and injectTranspilationRuntimeLibraries+normalization+destructuringPass+arrowFunctionPass. The helper MultiPassTest_Helpers.GetProcessor rebuilds `passes` with verbatim copies of the add*() methods and returns the verbatim getProcessor's PhaseOptimizer. addPeephole's getName() is the recorded harness.effective.getName. getOptions()'s setPrintSourceAfterEachPass(true) is replayed from record.options; setUp's and setDestructuringArrowFunctionOptions's harness setters are in harness.fields."
}
